<Slide style={{ padding: '60px', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 62 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26282E', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>评委最可能追问的两点，答案要提前站住</Text>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, width: '100%', background: '#D3DBE5', marginTop: 18 }} />
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 470, marginTop: 24 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 400, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 640, height: 400, background: '#F4F4F4', borderRadius: 8, borderTop: '4px solid #234B80', padding: 24, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4A73A8', letterSpacing: 1 }}>追问 01</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26282E', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 10 }}>状态同步能让 PVP / PVE 共用一套逻辑，是不是更省？</Text>
          <Box style={{ height: 1, width: '100%', background: '#D3DBE5', marginTop: 16, marginBottom: 16 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#234B80' }}>应答</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#26282E', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>帧同步下规则 F 本来就只有一份：PVE 是 step() 包装，PVP 是 stepAll()，同一个函数。状态同步买的是「F 只在权威端跑一次、客户端免确定性」，不是代码复用；一旦为手感加本地预测，和解复杂度又会回来。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 44, background: '#E6EDF5', paddingLeft: 14, paddingRight: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A3358' }}>依据：F 单一来源 / engine-net 不提供预测回滚</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 480, height: 400, background: '#F4F4F4', borderRadius: 8, borderTop: '4px solid #1A3358', padding: 24, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4A73A8', letterSpacing: 1 }}>追问 02</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26282E', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 10 }}>晚进局稳定落后几百 ms，是不是证明帧同步不行？</Text>
          <Box style={{ height: 1, width: '100%', background: '#D3DBE5', marginTop: 16, marginBottom: 16 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A3358' }}>应答</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#26282E', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>是当前实现缺口：开局 backlog &lt; 8 时 catchingUp 未置位，两端同速消费导致差距恒定。修法明确且只动时间轴装配；换模型不会自动消除延迟、插值与预测成本。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 44, background: '#E6EDF5', paddingLeft: 14, paddingRight: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A3358' }}>依据：armTimeline 时间轴装配 / 已知修法</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 44, marginTop: 16, background: '#E6EDF5', borderLeft: '4px solid #1A3358', paddingLeft: 20, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A3358' }}>所以：两个追问都指向实现细节，不构成切换同步模型的理由。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 20, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#666666' }}>答辩速答 · 不回避不利项</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#666666' }}>12 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
